sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Edge as Edge Pipeline
    participant Ingest as Backend Ingest API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Bus as RabbitMQ
    participant Dash as Dashboard / Notification

    Note over Edge,DB: Vehicle already parked, VehicleTrack(track_id)<br/>is actively tracked by ByteTrack across frames
    Edge->>Edge: detect same track_id, new point-in-polygon<br/>result != VehicleTrack.last known slot_id
    Edge->>Edge: confirm over N frames (debounce false positives)
    Edge->>Ingest: POST /api/v1/sites/{siteId}/ingest/events<br/>{eventId, occurredAt, type=VehicleRelocated,<br/>track_id, old_slot_id, new_slot_id, plate}
    Ingest->>DB: INSERT ParkingEvent (VehicleRelocated) +<br/>INSERT Outbox row (same tx)
    Ingest->>DB: INSERT ParkingHistory(tenant_id, plate,<br/>old_slot, new_slot, occurred_at)
    Ingest->>DB: UPDATE ParkingSlot old_slot_id status=free
    Ingest->>DB: UPDATE ParkingSlot new_slot_id status=occupied,<br/>current_vehicle_id
    Ingest->>DB: UPDATE Vehicle.current_slot_id = new_slot_id
    DB-->>Ingest: committed
    Ingest->>Bus: relay publish VehicleRelocated (outbox)
    Bus-->>Dash: consumer pushes live slot-map update +<br/>NotificationSent ("your car moved to A02")
    Ingest-->>Edge: 202 Accepted {eventId}

    Note over Edge,Dash: TARGET-ONLY flow. No relocation concept exists<br/>today (§1) — VehicleLog only records entry/exit type,<br/>no slot_id, no ParkingHistory table.
